1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,708
The fight continues after the punch.

2
00:00:02,708 --> 00:00:10,208
[Mechanical servo movement]
TheAI regains its footing.

3
00:00:10,208 --> 00:00:17,708
[Glove movement and impact]
The human and AI trade an exchange; neither wins.

4
00:00:17,708 --> 00:00:25,208
[Dark shifting texture]
A nonhumanoid cyber-threat spreads through the arena.

5
00:00:25,208 --> 00:00:32,708
Both fighters recognize the scale of the common threat.

6
00:00:32,708 --> 00:00:38,125
They stop fighting and acknowledge each other.

7
00:00:38,125 --> 00:00:39,208
TheAI studies the threat.

8
00:00:39,208 --> 00:00:41,708
The human directs theAI toward a shared target.

9
00:00:41,708 --> 00:00:49,208
[Faceted lattice contracts]
Working together, they contain the threat.

10
00:00:49,208 --> 00:00:56,208
HUMAN + AI
Speed. Context. Judgment. Accountability.
